Hi Cornell team,

We=E2=80=99re looking forward to welcoming you to Brown for IIC on November 5=
=E2=80=936!

Patrick Fang will be driving your team to Providence. We will reimburse gas a=
nd mileage, and Patrick will be in touch with more details about the travel a=
rrangements. Please coordinate directly with Patrick on pickup and timing.

Hotel: The Graduate, 11 Dorrance Street, Providence, RI 02903.
Check-in: Thursday, November 5 at noon ET.
Check-out: Friday, November 6 at 9 AM ET.
Two rooms per team, with two participants per room.

Please bring your student ID for check-in when you arrive. Feel free to reply=
 if you have any questions. We look forward to seeing you tomorrow!

Best,
The IIC Team

